╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                   ntc 2.4.9 - Command overview                   ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
  arc            Create and extract archives
  autoup         Manage startup programs [Windows Only]
  back           Go back to parent directory
  backup         Back up and restore a project
  betw           Print lines A to B
  care           Care (un-ignore) rules
  cd             Change directory
  clear          Clear the screen
  clip           Clipboard history
  config         Show or change ntc settings
  count          Count occurrences in text
  cp             Copy a file or directory
  cvcode         Convert between formats
  deadlock       Encrypted password vault
  decode         Decode hex, base64, URL, binary
  deinit         Remove project files
  dl             Download a file
  dns            DNS lookup
  doctor         Check config, PATH, ranfile and ntpkg
  ds             Search directories by name
  encode         Encode hex, base64, URL, binary
  exit           Exit ntc
  explorer       Full-screen file explorer
  fake           Generate fake data
  fgo            Find files and jump to one
  fmt            Convert between file formats
  fs             Search files by name
  fsc            Search files and open one
  git            Git shortcuts (status, branch, log)
  godrive        Switch drives or /mnt mounts
  gos            Pick a subdirectory to enter
  gosc           Browse subdirectories continuously
  gs             Search file contents
  head           Print the first lines of a file
  help           Show this help
  http           Make an HTTP request
  igcare         Import and export ignore/care rules
  igcared        Show all ignore/care settings
  ignore         Ignore dirs, files and extensions
  image          Show images inline in the terminal
  init           Initialize project files
  ipcfg          Show IP configuration
  line           Number each line
  local          Manage the per-directory config
  locate         Search files and directories
  math           Evaluate math expressions
  mkd            Create directories
  mkf            Create files
  mode           Admin / normal mode
  mv             Move or rename files and directories
  ndb            Browse SQLite databases
  ne             Open the built-in editor
  nms            Terminal music player
  nprintf        Bash-style formatted output
  nsheet         View spreadsheets
  nssh           SSH profiles and file copy
  ntpkg          Install and manage tools
  ntpx           Run an installed package binary
  opencg         Open config.toml in the editor
  pathcp         Copy the current path to clipboard
  ping           Ping a host
  pipe           Pipes, redirects and filters [NON-COMMAND]
  py_activate    Activate a Python venv
  py_deactivate  Deactivate the Python venv
  qr             Make and read QR codes
  qsc            Quick command listener
  qur            Query files and replace text
  ral            Run aliases
  ran            Run tasks from NTCRANFILE.toml
  report         Project reports (report project)
  resetcg        Reset config to defaults
  restorecg      Restore config from backup
  rev            Reverse each line
  rmd            Delete directories
  rmf            Delete files
  rnmd           Rename a directory
  rnmf           Rename a file
  run            Execute an alias
  say            Print text
  scan           Scan extensions, ports, IPs
  scr            Run saved script files
  serve          Serve a directory or app
  showcg         Show the current configuration
  showenv        Show environment and PATH
  size           Directory sizes
  skill          Install AI skills
  smtp           Send email (SMTP client)
  sort           Sort lines
  spec           Show computer specifications
  sys            Live system monitor
  syspath        Manage the system PATH
  tail           Print the last lines of a file
  theme          Switch, add, export themes
  time           Command timing and countdowns
  tl             Count lines in files
  tmprt          Temperature and weather
  todo           Project todo list
  tp             Saved paths (tp jump <name>)
  tpb            Teleport back to the previous location
  trace          Trace the route to a host
  trim           Strip a pattern from text
  tutorial       Guided hands-on lessons
  txtc           Copy file content to clipboard
  txtf           Display file content
  ui             Show current UI mode
  up             Upload a file
  usrpath        Manage the user PATH
  version        Show version
  view           Directory and file trees
  viewd          Directories-only tree
  viewf          Files-only tree
  views          Short flat directory listing
  where          Show the ntc path or find binaries
  wi             Live file-change feed

Type 'help <command>' for details, 'help --all' for the full reference.
